<Stack Gap="5" Grow>
    <TextBlock>
        The support team moved from a shared inbox to a queue in March. Each ticket now has an owner from the
        moment it arrives, and the team sees what's waiting by age instead of by who shouted last.
    </TextBlock>
    <Blockquote Variant="BlockquoteVariant.Plain" Align="TextAlign.Center" QuoteMark Accent="Accent.Primary" Size="TextSize.Xl">
        Nobody has to ask who's on it anymore.
    </Blockquote>
    <TextBlock>
        Within six weeks, the median first reply fell from six hours to 48 minutes.
    </TextBlock>
</Stack>
